The Honest Assessment
Easy to implement:

Basic agent creation
Simple keyword monitoring
RSS feed aggregation
API calls to known sources

Hard to implement well:

Context understanding
Relevance filtering
Quality assessment
Evolution tracking
Noise reduction

The Practical Path:

Start with well-defined topics in known domains
Build pattern libraries from successful agents
Use human review for new topic types
Gradually increase automation as patterns emerge
Accept that some topics will need manual configuration

The real value isn't in perfect automation, but in scaling human expertise through semi-automated systems.

